      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cleveland%2C_Mississippi"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Louisville, New Orleans & Texas Railroad ran through Cleveland, and the town still preserves a section of that historic line today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cleveland%2C_Mississippi"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dockery Plantation near Cleveland, home to blues pioneer Charley Patton, now operates as an open‑air museum free to explore.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
